  "label": "Relatable Meme Format",
  "description": "The visual of a distressed person looking at a screen with text overlay is a widely recognized meme format used to express frustration, helplessness, or despair. This format is often used to convey situations that are universally relatable, such as dealing with complex tasks, bad news, or frustrating technology. The image is a visual shorthand for 'I am overwhelmed by this situation.'",
